<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37467" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξόδ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
				an exit,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. νόμοι</span>
			<i>finale</i> of a play, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				276
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξόδιον</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλος</span>), τό, <i>finale of a tragedy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philist.
				42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				75
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>catastrophe, tragical conclusion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Crass.</u>
				33
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦν ὁ χειμὼν ἐπ᾽ ἐξοδίοις ἤδη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1.26b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Lat.
				<i>exodium, after-piece,</i> Liv.<i><span class="en">
				7.2
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Juv.
				3.175
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suet.
				<u>Tib.</u>
				45
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> among
			the Jews, <i>a feast to commemorate the Exodus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				23.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>De.</u>
				16.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>gateway,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				243.16
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">i A. D.</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ωδ-</span>
			Pap.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
